{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"MediaWiki REST revision HTML, sanitized","nodeCount":314,"content":[{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwAQ"},"children":[{"type":"p","props":{},"children":[]}]},{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwAw"},"children":[{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwBQ"},"children":[]},{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwBw"},"children":[{"type":"h2","props":{"id":"Cash"},"children":["Cash"]},"\n"]},{"type":"span","props":{"id":"mwCA"},"children":["\n\n\n"]},{"type":"p","props":{},"children":[]},"\n\n"]},{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwCw"},"children":[{"type":"h2","props":{"id":"Description"},"children":["Description"]},"\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Cash"]}," is the gameplay currency used in Tower Defense Simulator, though it is sometimes simply just referred to as ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Money"]},". This is entirely separate from other currencies, like ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{},"children":["Coin"]}]}," ",{"type":"span","props":{},"children":["Coins"]}]}," in that it is only used in actual gameplay. You are not rewarded any ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Cash"]}," upon the completion of a game, nor does it transfer over to ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{},"children":["Coin"]}]}," ",{"type":"span","props":{},"children":["Coins"]}]},". ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Cash"]}," is for the most part spent on buying and upgrading towers while playing a game, but on rare occasions, it can also be used for other things, such as purchasing plots in ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/D00M's_Revenge","title":"D00M's Revenge"},"children":["D00M's Revenge"]},"."]},"\n\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["The starting amount of cash depends on the gamemode, or event. If you are in the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"https://web.roblox.com/groups/4914494/Paradoxum-Games"},"children":["Paradoxum Games"]}," community group, you will receive an additional ",{"type":"span","props":{"id":"mwFg"},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{},"children":["Cash"]}]},"$100"]}," at the start of each game. The primary source of ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Cash"]}," is when towers damage enemies. You also get ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Cash"]}," upon the completion of every wave. Some towers, like the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Farm","title":"Farm"},"children":["Farm"]},", ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/DJ_Booth","title":"DJ Booth"},"children":["DJ Booth"]},", ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Cowboy","title":"Cowboy"},"children":["Cowboy"]}," or ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Golden_Cowboy","title":"Golden Cowboy"},"children":["Golden Cowboy"]},", also grant an additional source of ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Cash"]},"."]},"\n\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["The amount of ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Cash"]}," you get when you complete a wave depends on the gamemode (or event). Additionally, shared ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Cash"]}," (",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Cash"]}," earned by other players) will vary across gamemodes."]},"\n\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["It takes the appearance of a stack of cash."]},"\n\n"]},{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwIw"},"children":[{"type":"h2","props":{"id":"Gallery"},"children":["Gallery"]},"\n",{"type":"div","props":{"id":"mwJA"},"children":["\n\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{},"children":[{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Previous Versions"]}]}]},"\n",{"type":"ul","props":{},"children":["\n",{"type":"li","props":{},"children":[{"type":"div","props":{"id":"mwJw"},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{"id":"mwKA"},"children":[{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/File:Money.png","title":"Original Cash icon (13 October 2019 – 29 October 2020)."},"ch